OL,3,ARussian stadium says it won't host
OL,4,AKanye West gigs
OL,5,
OL,6,FGazprom Arena acknowledged it had
OL,7,Freceived complaints about West's
OL,8,Fplanned appearance and stressed that it
OL,9,F"was not and is not" responsible for
OL,10,Fhis booking.
